<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Draw the surrounding air in through the respirator for a few seconds. Smoke, tox gas and other gases near the pilot will be pulled in and cleared, even as they move. If a tank is worn, whatever is drawn in will be filtered and stored in it as tox gas. -->
  <TXWC_AbsorbGas.description>通过呼吸器吸入周围空气数秒。驾驶员附近的烟雾、毒气和其他气体即使在移动，也会被吸入并清除。若穿戴了毒气罐，吸入的气体会经过滤后作为毒气存入罐中。</TXWC_AbsorbGas.description>
  <!-- EN: Using ability: {0} -->
  <TXWC_AbsorbGas.jobReportString>使用{0}。</TXWC_AbsorbGas.jobReportString>
  <!-- EN: absorb gas -->
  <TXWC_AbsorbGas.label>吸收气体</TXWC_AbsorbGas.label>
  <!-- EN: absorb gas -->
  <TXWC_AbsorbGas.verbProperties.label>吸收气体</TXWC_AbsorbGas.verbProperties.label>

  <!-- EN: Open the tank's vents and release tox gas around the pilot. The cloud will grow from wherever the pilot stands and follow them as they move. Toggle again to close the vents and keep what is left. -->
  <TXWC_VentTank.description>打开毒气罐的排气阀，在驾驶员周围释放毒气。毒气云会从驾驶员所在位置扩散开来，并随驾驶员移动。再次切换可关闭排气阀，保留剩余的毒气。</TXWC_VentTank.description>
  <!-- EN: Using ability: {0} -->
  <TXWC_VentTank.jobReportString>使用{0}。</TXWC_VentTank.jobReportString>
  <!-- EN: vent tank -->
  <TXWC_VentTank.label>排放罐内毒气</TXWC_VentTank.label>
  <!-- EN: vent tank -->
  <TXWC_VentTank.verbProperties.label>排放罐内毒气</TXWC_VentTank.verbProperties.label>

</LanguageData>
